                                        <persName role="owner" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15458Rey"><roleName type="rank">Generale</roleName> Felice Rey
                                            </persName>.</desc>
                                    <q xml:lang="it">Donato dal tenente Celoria al gen. Rey nel 1895</q>
                                </item>
                            </list>
                        </additions>
                    </physDesc>
                    <history>
                        <origin>
                            <origDate notBefore="1800" notAfter="1895">Nineteenth century</origDate>
                        </origin>
                        <provenance>The first owner of the scroll was a person, whose name was probably 
                            <persName role="owner" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15456WalattaMi">Walatta Mikāʾel</persName>.
                            Her name was replaced by that of another woman, 
                            <persName role="owner" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15457WalattaMad">Walatta Madḫǝn</persName>, 
                            whose name was written in black.</provenance>
                    </history>
